### Architecture Diagram

```
COMPANY RESEARCH TRANSFORMATION LAYER

  API Handler ──▶ CompanyResearchTransformer ──▶ FVS Validator ──▶ DynamoDB
                    │                              │
                    ▼                              ▼
              Cache Check                   Grammar >= 9.0
              (TTL 30 days)                 Anti-AI >= 9.0
```

### Data Flow

| Stage | Component | Transformation |
|-------|-----------|----------------|
| 1 | API Handler | Receives user_email + company_name |
| 2 | Cache Check | Returns cached if TTL valid |
| 3 | LLM Call | Generates CompanyResearchData (10 fields) |
| 4 | FVS Validate | Grammar >= 9.0, Anti-AI >= 9.0 |
| 5 | Transform | LLM output → DynamoDB item |
| 6 | DynamoDB | Store with TTL (30 days) |

---

**Generated:** 2026-02-14
**Architect Agent:** Claude Opus
**Status:** COMPLETE - ALL COMPONENTS GENERATED
